cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Boring Log Viewer"
abstract: >-
  Renders geotechnical boring logs from JSON, AGS4 or DIGGS data as standalone
  SVG drawings: graphic log with USCS and material symbols, material
  descriptions, samples, blow counts, laboratory specimens and groundwater.
  It also draws automatic cross-sections and a 3D layer model from several
  borings at a site. It runs as a web page in the browser, as a render API
  for scripts, and as a JavaScript module.
